    <title>sortEigenvalues()</title>
<indexterm><primary>sortEigenvalues</primary><secondary>GLM_GTX_pca</secondary></indexterm>
<indexterm><primary>GLM_GTX_pca</primary><secondary>sortEigenvalues</secondary></indexterm>
<computeroutput>template&lt;typename <link linkend="__u_p_r_i_s_e___e_n_g_i_n_e_2_header_e_2_c_o_r_e_2_c___i_n_p_u_t_8h_1a0acb682b8260ab1c60b918599864e2e5">T</link> , <link linkend="_namespaceglm_1a36ed105b07c7746804d7fdc7cc90ff25">qualifier</link> Q&gt; </computeroutput><para><computeroutput><link linkend="_setup_8hpp_1a364212a7fa4148cd960bd919442c4fc8">GLM_FUNC_DISCARD_DECL</link> <link linkend="_d3dcommon_8h_1a7c519f1a5c88707e509aba3a18925f3a">void</link> glm::sortEigenvalues (<link linkend="_structglm_1_1vec">vec</link>&lt; 4, <link linkend="__u_p_r_i_s_e___e_n_g_i_n_e_2_header_e_2_c_o_r_e_2_c___i_n_p_u_t_8h_1a0acb682b8260ab1c60b918599864e2e5">T</link>, <link linkend="__u_p_r_i_s_e___e_n_g_i_n_e_2_header_e_2_c_o_r_e_2_c___i_n_p_u_t_8h_1acbcee443d6d55cb8600b3f240f5cf907">Q</link> &gt; &amp; eigenvalues, <link linkend="_structglm_1_1mat">mat</link>&lt; 4, 4, <link linkend="__u_p_r_i_s_e___e_n_g_i_n_e_2_header_e_2_c_o_r_e_2_c___i_n_p_u_t_8h_1a0acb682b8260ab1c60b918599864e2e5">T</link>, <link linkend="__u_p_r_i_s_e___e_n_g_i_n_e_2_header_e_2_c_o_r_e_2_c___i_n_p_u_t_8h_1acbcee443d6d55cb8600b3f240f5cf907">Q</link> &gt; &amp; eigenvectors)</computeroutput></para>
<para>Assuming the provided covariance matrix <computeroutput>covarMat</computeroutput> is symmetric and real-valued, this function find the <computeroutput>D</computeroutput> Eigenvalues of the matrix, and also provides the corresponding Eigenvectors. Note: the data in <computeroutput>outEigenvalues</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>outEigenvectors</computeroutput> are in matching order, i.e. <computeroutput>outEigenvector[i]</computeroutput> is the Eigenvector of the Eigenvalue <computeroutput>outEigenvalue[i]</computeroutput>. This is a numeric implementation to find the Eigenvalues, using &apos;QL decomposition` (variant of QR decomposition: <link xlink:href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/QR_decomposition">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/QR_decomposition</link>). / /
